  <item>
    <title>EP3 ADHD如何利用AI工具？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646e2a8f1672628240f7facd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646e2a8f1672628240f7facd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 May 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期从实用主义出发最后变得非常哲学的讨论。</span></p><p><span>这次同样是建议不习惯慢语速的朋友们倍速服用。</span></p><p><span>嘉宾Cassie：教育科技方向博士，研究人工智能和计算思维的培养，小红书：KKK_Cassie啊</span></p><p><span>嘉宾C君：之前在日本硬件制造商做图像处理AI，目前在咨询公司，小红书：橘女士</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 枕侠的ADHD女性戏剧成员/访谈募集</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> 嘉宾Cassie：教育科技方向博士，研究人工智能和计算思维的培养</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> 嘉宾C君：之前在硬件制造商做图像处理AI，目前在咨询公司</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 教育学中对ADHD的（有局限的）描述</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> AI训练过程中的发散与收束</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a> 考虑AI能够如何帮助ADHD时，首先需要考虑ADHD需要什么来自人的帮助</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a> AI应用畅想：协助处理琐碎事务</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> AI发展热门方向：助手和学习伙伴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a> AI可以帮助减少社会资源的分配失衡（减少ADHD税）吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2073">34:33</a> AI在儿童教育中的潜在用途</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">36:53</a> 驾驶中的缺陷问题对策</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> AI伴侣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2511">41:51</a> 苏格拉底式的辩论者：帮助控制冲动倾向造成的负面影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> ADHD需要什么样的外力来控制冲动？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2859">47:39</a> 多巴胺断食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3042">50:42</a> 意志力的迷思</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> 为什么精英教育体制下的是“幸存者”依旧痛苦？AI可以帮助改变什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3505">58:25</a> 重要的问题：所以成功是什么呢？教育的意义又是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 让AI成为我们人生的co-pilot</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3715">1:01:55</a> AI是不是有可能把我们从学历焦虑里解脱出来？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4493">1:14:53</a> （逐渐跑题）苏格拉底和阿德勒理论的共通之处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4726">1:18:46</a> 硅基生命（AI）在乎自己算碳基生命（人类）吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5468">1:31:08</a> AI好像是一个特别不ADHD的东西</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5884">1:38:04</a> 科技没有善恶 但人有</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6017">1:40:17</a> 对三体式 德国教育系统的吐槽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6346">1:45:46</a> 通过塞尔达/吃鸡 感悟人生意义：存在先于本质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6639">1:50:39</a> 社会无法允许异类的存在 是因为无法有效沟通 AI可以成为有效的翻译器</span></p><p><span>参考信息：</span></p><p><span>枕侠ADHD女性戏剧招募报名入口 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6468e0a7000000000703b19c?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=7.87.1&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;type=normal&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=56a38ebf50c4b418c699cf25&amp;apptime=1684930168" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6468e0a7000000000703b19c?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=7.87.1&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;type=normal&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=56a38ebf50c4b418c699cf25&amp;apptime=1684930168"><span>小红书</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://m.weibo.cn/detail/4903651938140220" data-url="https://m.weibo.cn/detail/4903651938140220"><span>微博</span></a></p><p><span>许倬云：全世界人类曾经走过的路，都算我走过的路 | 十三邀</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QMYgvCkOpsYlbQ1Eld2kkg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QMYgvCkOpsYlbQ1Eld2kkg"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><p><span>AI男友：Replika：</span><a href="https://replika.com/" data-url="https://replika.com/"><span>replika.com</span></a></p><p><span>AI女友：CarynAI</span></p><p><span>Cassie分享的多动症/Dancer视频：</span><strong><span>Ken Robinson - She's Not Sick, She's A Dancer</span></strong><span> </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HpCIQKSqDd4" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HpCIQKSqDd4"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><p><span>练英文口语的AI助手：Call Annie：</span><a href="https://callsam.ai/" data-url="https://callsam.ai/"><span>callsam.ai</span></a></p><p><span>AI编曲工具：Aiva：</span><a href="https://www.aiva.ai/" data-url="https://www.aiva.ai/"><span>www.aiva.ai</span></a></p><p><span>《我遇见了人类》：</span><a href="https://m.douban.com/book/subject/26811138/" data-url="https://m.douban.com/book/subject/26811138/"><span>m.douban.com</span></a></p><p><span>《每当你找到人生的意义，它就又变了》：</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/27011409//" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/27011409//"><span>book.douban.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv0TqDU0wh1wMGUdSktw2WcQE_Z8.m4a" length="111904556" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:54:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FofnWeNEcl10yn3k7g9ch64fCOr2.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep2 如何让长期规划挺过三天热度？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/644385a59361a4e7c331ed7d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">644385a59361a4e7c331ed7d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们，这次录制我们学到了一个宝贵的教训，就是不要在工作日晚上安排录制…录制时两位主播都已经被工作虐蔫了，执行功能所剩无几，情绪也非常的不饱满，但由于DDL近在眼前不得不硬着头皮上，还好有2个投稿撑场面（？）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次同样是建议不习惯慢语速的朋友们倍速服用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期播客里，我们聊了一个让很多三心二意的ADHDers头痛的话题——做长期规划：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 一次失败的德语学习经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> 可持续的长期规划框架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> 任务界也有自然选择，留不下来的就是不够想要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> “放弃”有时只是计划的转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a> 不断自我更新的计划才是可持续的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1131">18:51</a> 模块化任务，及时“保存进度”并获得正向反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 枕侠的跨专业考研经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 背水一战的myth</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 测试并调节预期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> 投稿1：萱萱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3202">53:22</a> 投稿2：成尘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4251">1:10:51</a> 下次内容预告！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj8wCBITUfDItPCnwDKwM-LuzvCs.m4a" length="71701281" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FofnWeNEcl10yn3k7g9ch64fCOr2.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep1 分心不是我的错 那些了解ADHD后才知道的事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641afce2179eec53310feb4c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">641afce2179eec53310feb4c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Mar 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期我们分享了一些ADHD的典型/非典型症状。两位主播以为自己语速很快但剪完发现还是挺慢的，所以还是建议需要的朋友倍速服用。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 情绪失控：一激动就会哭，无法控制</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 感统失调：听觉/视觉/触觉敏感</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1577">26:17</a> 精细运动障碍：拿筷子困难户</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1819">30:19</a> 驾驶安全问题</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> 我们很幸运地生活在一个有很多“脚手架”的时代：AI工具的普及对ADHD群体的意义</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 时间概念缺失</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2687">44:47</a> Hyperfocus:失控的注意力阀门</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2923">48:43</a> 如何利用Hyperfocus？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3104">51:44</a> Self medication 自我药疗（如咖啡，酒精等）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">57:06</a> 坐立不安（以及赞美远程办公）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">1:01:50</a> 憋不住话</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3917">1:05:17</a> 个人卫生习惯</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">1:13:00</a> 无法做长期规划（如财务规划）</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltWD5-ew-1Ybxmyv-VyB-39C81aJ.m4a" length="83044482" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:25:04</itunes:duration>
